":"3","high":"3"},"solution":"<p>3 (3 - 3)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/23e82f15f450069ed6c808057360e9f9b180a328.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":8,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>Consider the logical function given below:</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/6c40141a7388501a77d55e0afae622458a1ca5de.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>If ‘<em>f</em><sub>out</sub>’ is logic zero, the maximum number of possible minterms of function <em>f</em><sub>3</sub>(<em>A</em>, <em>B</em>, <em>C</em>) is equal to _______.</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"6","high":"6"},"solution":"<p>6 (6 - 6)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/c9d675a96c453834f51c23aba4718e2186ca104a.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":9,"type":"MSQ","correct":"A,C","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>The below logic expression is to be realized using either two-input NAND Gates or two input NOR Gates:</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/a0e13f2eef794894dae9e2b8ccdf49a8014dc0df.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>Which of the following statements is/are correct?</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> Number of two-input NAND gates required are 5.</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> Number of two-input NOR gates required are 3.</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> Number of two-input NOR gates required are 5.</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> Number of two-input NAND gates required are 4.</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(a, c)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/9cc670dc82cb3bda5d6df75b0571fc114f28b5d3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":10,"type":"MCQ","correct":"D","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>The simplified SOP form for the Boolean expression given below using the 5-variable <em>K</em>-Map is obtained as</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/aa85ffa390bed8dae972af072e996e82d8164a05.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/3792226db09714a0d46c1de0268712250431fc2c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/7c795baf9358e6ad60ac8ecc34d7f83e1e98f582.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/d5de283084eba47a04afbd68d0748babf6b455d7.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/1c80966a2d8fc3c16279a2f96a491fe63ab3ea6e.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(d)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/9fde277cbffc71f867efbe06e3582d0f94ff046c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":11,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>A combinational circuit is defined by the following three Boolean functions:</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/9fa8871323baafe031ce5a88dda8ef0ced79ca63.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>Which of the following decoder circuit correctly realizes the given combinational circuit?</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/227f837a821b82f510a232b61384abd2a3e594fa.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/48a8fc9fe4e8676599d6090d4fc9d04125144ae8.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/2df8c8ba70c085d3c4da013f35b55e386fd7b863.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/e503a004c475c1a8c26ca60e96908080431adb05.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(a)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/7929ae8b075c6dab62ccead7040e4e3bef4c9d70.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/98e43da01f91642ed4e93debedd226d7b291c8a3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":12,"type":"MCQ","correct":"B","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>For the parallel adder shown in figure, the complete sum and carry by analysis of the logical operation of the circuit is given by given by __________.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/a6ae0f561133184e40525dacdc1a55216693fa20.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/21f95c92ba95441611bc2afde53373b9b9d1d587.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/2f5b8d5ef0691d0a044d08165ccfe2fbf1cdda0a.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/5fc13fa9dca1165a1815e4a44b1578e1621b1538.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/a6ee05933f956d6fd47c4d303a4d4935345e4802.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(b)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/e8d7a65dd46cf7f209b00fa76c16d388ea1650ce.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":13,"type":"MCQ","correct":"D","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>After the simplification of a 3-variable Boolean function</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/2a04d24653a06e6db30bfaef7f5bf0bd70abbd2b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>the number of gates required to implement the logic circuit is given by</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> 1-AND and 2-OR gate</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> Only 1-AND gate</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> 2-AND and 1-OR gate</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> 1-AND and 1-OR gate</div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(d)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/eae8cc292a7633bfe666c1912017586050cc5dba.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":14,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>A logical function is given as</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/47938f021cfd199112e3128065463e266c82374b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>The sum of number of essential prime implicants and prime implicants in the given Boolean function will be ____.</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"19","high":"19"},"solution":"<p>19 (19 - 19)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/ea783dcf34eb1b04cde77032368a8ebbb42e1536.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":15,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>\n Consider a 4-bit number <em>A</em> and 2-bit number <em>B</em> are given to a multiplier. The output of multiplier is realized using AND gate and one bit full adders. If minimum number of AND gates required are <em>X</em> and one bit full adders required are Y, then <em>X</em> – <em>Y</em> = _____.</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"4","high":"4"},"solution":"<p>\n 4 (4 - 4)</p>\n<p>\n <img src=\"/media/08438ad18d6b8b721abd5bc213d17f02f35e201b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":16,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>If a signed arithmetic subtraction is performed in an 8-bit CPU, where CPU is accumulator based, the status of carry and overflow flags for the instruction ‘SUB C’ are ______. where, [ACC] = F9H ; [C] = 74H</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> 0, 1</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> 1, 0</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> 0, 0</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> 1, 1</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(c)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/a20d11c78643d27e8be461f156714c2821ce81d2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/81c584f6ebe876ccbfaa861b7fdecc2c658311d9.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p> </p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":17,"type":"MSQ","correct":"A,B","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>Consider the following expression:<br />\nF(A, B, C, D) = Σm(1, 3, 6, 7, 8, 11, 13, 14)<br />\nThe above expression is to be implemented using, 4 × 1 multiplexer by connecting <em>B</em> and <em>D</em> to the select lines <em>S</em><sub>1</sub> and <em>S</em><sub>0</sub> respectively. Then which of the following inputs to the MUX data lines is/ are correct?</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/8cdb924e569367957a40f44d7bdb18679bfaebf2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/adae126608af5a5f8e0730e01008a50dab1c82f9.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/c377c1b88dc5e322f754d6023d28c34216ac6316.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/b32d3c44d9e308f1cfa703a1ce391ee098ff00db.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(a, b)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/88db28ce79adbb1d5ca836bc92b80170c25ef285.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"}],"questionCount":17,"parsedAt":"2026-11-10T19:39:15.820Z"}